  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#flow-content-3:attr-div-align says to set text-align to center/left/right, and then do magic centering.\r\n\r\nHowever, that doesn't match implementations, see https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10388.\r\n\r\nAssuming https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10388 decides to specify this using the `-webkit-` prefixed keywords, would people be fine just mapping to that (matching reality)?",
